  "description": "Bring a playful pop of color to your designs with this neon polka dot seamless pattern featuring vivid pink, yellow, blue, and green. The lively combination of brilliant rose, chartreuse, han purple, and medium spring green gives this classic dotted design a bold, modern twist. Perfect for cheerful backgrounds, quirky stationery, colorful packaging, and creative print projects, this repeating pattern adds a fun and energetic touch to any composition. Use these bright dots to create standout digital artwork, retro-inspired graphics, and eye-catching handmade crafts.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 15 seamless patterns\n• Format: JPEG\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n• Scrapbooking and junk journals\n• Digital paper and printable backgrounds\n• Fabric prints and textile designs\n• Wrapping paper and gift packaging\n• Planners, notebooks, and stationery\n• Y2K, retro, and pop art projects\n• Party invitations and decorations\n• Stickers, cards, and crafts\n• Social media graphics and digital collages\n• Bold branding and creative DIY projects",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring a playful pop of color to your designs with this neon polka dot seamless pattern featuring vivid pink, yellow, blue, and green. The lively combination of brilliant rose, chartreuse, han purple, and medium spring green gives this classic dotted design a bold, modern twist. Perfect for cheerful backgrounds, quirky stationery, colorful packaging, and creative print projects, this repeating pattern adds a fun and energetic touch to any composition. Use these bright dots to create standout digital artwork, retro-inspired graphics, and eye-catching handmade crafts.</p>\n<p>✨What’s Included:<br>\n• 15 seamless patterns<br>\n• Format: JPEG<br>\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px<br>\n• High-resolution digital files</p>\n<p>✨Perfect for:<br>\n• Scrapbooking and junk journals<br>\n• Digital paper and printable backgrounds<br>\n• Fabric prints and textile designs<br>\n• Wrapping paper and gift packaging<br>\n• Planners, notebooks, and stationery<br>\n• Y2K, retro, and pop art projects<br>\n• Party invitations and decorations<br>\n• Stickers, cards, and crafts<br>\n• Social media graphics and digital collages<br>\n• Bold branding and creative DIY projects</p>",
